@startuml Create Competition Sequence
actor Organizer
participant Frontend
participant Backend
participant Database

Organizer -> Frontend: Fill competition form
Frontend -> Backend: POST /api/competitions
Backend -> Backend: Validate organizer role
alt Not organizer
    Backend --> Frontend: Error response
    Frontend --> Organizer: Show error
else Valid organizer
    Backend -> Database: Create competition
    Database --> Backend: Created competition
    Backend --> Frontend: Success response
    Frontend --> Organizer: Show success and redirect
end
@enduml
